  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit Program for Small Caribbean States</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Crdito para Pases Pequeos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM IS CONTINUATION OF ACTIVITIES FUNDED UNDER LOANS 488OC-RG AND 758SF-RG, AND WOULD PROVIDE FINANCING FOR INFRASTRUCTURE INVESTMENTS, FOR SOCIAL PROJECTS AND TO REPAIR DAMAGE CAUSED BY RECENT HURRICANES. THIS ASSISTANCE WILL BE DIRECTED TO THE SMALL COUNTRIES THAT ARE BORROWING MEMBERS OF CDB, BUT WHICH ARE NOT MEMBERS OF THE IDB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
